  "verse_id": "kul-p16-v377",
  "song": "kul-p16",
  "verse": 377,
  "plain_english": "Indeed, knowledge superior to the Vedas is not; nor is equal vision of Kaula.",
  "sanskrit_cite": "na hi vedādhikā vidyā na kaulasamadarśanam",
